{"title": "Hunter's Eye", "pageid": 28353, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hunter's_Eye", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Hunter's Eye</b> is a passive feature that increases the damage against creatures marked by certain spells.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain a <span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <b>+1d4</b> bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> against creatures marked by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_(Condition)\" title=\"Hunter's Mark Quarry (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hunter's Mark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hunter%27s_Mark_Quarry_(Condition)\" title=\"Hunter's Mark Quarry (Condition)\">Hunter's Mark</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike_(Condition)\" title=\"True Strike (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"True Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike_(Condition)\" title=\"True Strike (Condition)\">True Strike</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Faerie Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\">Faerie Fire</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Bolt_(Condition)\" title=\"Guiding Bolt (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guiding Bolt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Guiding_Bolt_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Bolt_(Condition)\" title=\"Guiding Bolt (Condition)\">Guiding Bolt</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Circlet_of_Hunting\" title=\"Circlet of Hunting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Circlet_of_Blasting_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Circlet_of_Blasting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Circlet_of_Blasting_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Circlet_of_Blasting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Circlet_of_Blasting_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Circlet_of_Blasting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Circlet_of_Blasting_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Circlet_of_Blasting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Circlet_of_Blasting_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Circlet_of_Hunting\" title=\"Circlet of Hunting\">Circlet of Hunting</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Though not stated in the description, Hunter's Eye also functions with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/20px-Hex_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/30px-Hex_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/40px-Hex_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hex\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp/20px-Hex_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Hex_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hex\" title=\"Hex\">Hex</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Hunter's Eye requires the wearer to be the <i>source</i> of the mentioned conditions on the target; it does not provide an attack roll bonus if another character is the source of the conditions.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201100\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2252/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18719/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6891/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 860287/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.423      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   54.423      1 -total\n 32.39%   17.627      4 Template:Cond\n 28.51%   15.515      6 Template:Icon_text\n 25.08%   13.651     18 Template:Trim\n 17.73%    9.647      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 17.19%    9.358      8 Template:Ifempty\n 16.17%    8.802      1 Template:Attack_Roll\n 14.30%    7.780      5 Template:Icon_link\n 13.66%    7.436      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28353-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201100 and revision id 371939. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}